data: {"id": "b0ae216c5f91449a-final", "run_id": "b0ae216c5f91449a", "seq": 900, "ts_ms": 1789104619710, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v01/workload 处于 Pending 状态且无法调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning FailedScheduling 103s default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod. | 确认调度失败及具体原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | PodScheduled=False, message=\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.\" (2026-09-11T05:28:07Z) | 记录 Pod 调度状态失败的确切事实 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | phase=\"Pending\" (Pod phase), status=\"Pending\" (Diagnosis) | 确认 Pod 处于不可调度的最终状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | container.app.cpu_request=\"100k\", container.app.memory_request=\"8Mi\" | 确定调度失败的资源需求上下文 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件 (事实 1) 与 Pod 状态条件 (事实 2) 高度一致，共同指向 `Insufficient cpu` 和 `No preemption victims found` 两个核心约束。这表明集群不仅资源不足，且无法通过抢占释放资源。资源配置 (事实 4) 提供了需求端的数据，与事件中的原因相互印证。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群所有可用节点 CPU 资源耗尽 → 调度器拒绝调度且无抢占候选人 → Pod 处于 Pending 状态 (PodScheduled=False) → 用户可见 Pod 未运行\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**集群所有可用节点的 CPU 资源均已耗尽，且不存在可被抢占的 Pod 来释放资源**。\n\n具体依据如下：\n1.  **资源耗尽**：调度器报告 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu`，表明集群内所有节点均无法提供 Pod 所需的 CPU 资源（至少为 100k，见事实 4）。\n2.  **无法动态调节**：报告 `No preemption victims found for incoming pod`，说明在当前集群状态下，没有优先级较低的 Pod 可以被抢占以腾出资源，导致 Pod 陷入永久 Pending 状态。\n\n该结论由 Kubernetes 事件 (事实 1) 和 Pod 状态 (事实 2) 直接支撑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 58.6s\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 31.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v01/workload: 31.9s (Evidence 23.8s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v01/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 58.559, "metrics": {"run_id": "b0ae216c5f91449a", "mttr": {"value": "58.6s", "seconds": 58.56505346298218, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 58565.05346298218, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 55843.83511543274, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 6267.879486083984, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2399.0631103515625}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18234.55858230591, "